<li><a href="#sec-2">Tank size and refueling rhythm</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Comparing verified rental models</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">Fuel stops as part of your route</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-5">Fuel planning for long stays</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-6">Budgeting fuel with rental cost</a></li>
